{"availability":"available","full":"zirafa/pushtape-cassette","name":"pushtape-cassette","description":"A lightweight framework for building static music apps. Make a cassette.json of your music and render a complete music site in seconds, featuring a persistent music player.","category":"Developer tools","language":"CSS","stars":27,"forks":9,"created":"2016-08-09T17:27:55Z","updated":"2025-08-18T01:27:39Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"http://pushtape.com/demo/cassette/","topics":["javascript","music","python","static-site","webapp"],"demo":"http://www.pushtape.com/demo/cassette","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T13:01:54.879Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T13:01:54.879Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T13:01:54.879Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T13:01:54.879Z","stars":27,"forks":9}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Pushtape Cassette is a lightweight framework for building better music web applications. Make a cassette of your music and render a complete music web app in seconds, featuring a persistent music player.","This project creates a static music webapp that can be integrated with any number of backend technologies: flat files, Wordpress/Drupal, JS Frameworks, Python, and Ruby. The key element that powers this idea is the cassette.json file, a portable discography format. This file acts like a single comprehensive endpoint - and from this endpoint, javascript is used to create a single-page-application using various micro-libraries.","A lot of music sites are fairly static but have tricky frontend requirements. The best music UX allows for an uninterrupted music listening experience while performing other tasks such as reading liner notes, browsing other music, etc. Usually this means AJAXifying a traditional CMS/static site or building a complete solution from scratch using JS. This quickly becomes a headache to build and maintain, especially in the long term. By creating a decoupled frontend framework, it allows for better separation of concerns and lowers the long-term effort required to build and maintain a site.…"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zirafa/pushtape-cassette/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"43bdc810cf3d7be9c3692df3beba4c7272fa67987f62de21def44514ae78712f","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T13:01:55.239Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T13:01:55.239Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Pushtape Cassette is a lightweight framework for building better music web applications. Make a cassette of your music and render a complete music web app in seconds, featuring a persistent music player.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zirafa/pushtape-cassette/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"43bdc810cf3d7be9c3692df3beba4c7272fa67987f62de21def44514ae78712f","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zirafa/pushtape-cassette/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T13:01:55.239Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2025-08-18T01:27:39Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zirafa/pushtape-cassette/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T13:01:55.240Z","hash":"43bdc810cf3d7be9c3692df3beba4c7272fa67987f62de21def44514ae78712f","originalBytes":11063,"storedBytes":11063,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["releases","music","cassette.json","file","path","pages","url","assets","files","release","static","add","build","markdown","artwork","page","run","server","value","any","app","i.e.","index.html","jsonp","key","load","location","micro-libraries","need","notes","notes.md","other","remote","should","using","web","about","artist","artwork.jpg","base","because","contains","cross-origin","default","directory","dub.py","example-release","example-release-two","format","inside","jspf","like","note","playlist","python","release-title","router","tracklist.jspf","type","urls","api","bootstrap","cassette","css","defines","description","directory.","each","